{"id":"ra_pidamente","lemma":"rápidamente","pos":"adv","rank":1411,"glosses":["rapidly, quickly"],"ipa":"/ˌrapidaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/13/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-r%C3%A1pidamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Un caballo corre rápidamente.","en":"A horse runs quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/937803"},{"text":"Haz tu trabajo rápidamente.","en":"Do your work quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800858"},{"text":"Cierra la puerta rápidamente.","en":"Shut the door quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/462036"},{"text":"La moda cambia rápidamente.","en":"Fashions change quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460794"},{"text":"Ella se giró rápidamente.","en":"She turned around quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524873"}]}